WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.373 --> 00:00:03.107
Unit nine. My Body!

2
00:00:04.109 --> 00:00:12.737
Hello, everyone! I'm Teacher Chanthy. Welcome to C2-EPE Master English, Beginner level!

3
00:00:12.787 --> 00:00:17.093
Hi, Teacher Chanthy! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:17.143 --> 00:00:20.417
Today we learn: My Body. Let's go!

5
00:00:21.104 --> 00:00:24.471
Head. Say it with me. Head!

6
00:00:27.971 --> 00:00:31.421
Hand. Say it with me. Hand!

7
00:00:34.902 --> 00:00:38.468
Foot. Say it with me. Foot!

8
00:00:41.970 --> 00:00:45.270
Eye. Say it with me. Eye!

9
00:00:48.774 --> 00:00:52.308
Ear. Say it with me. Ear!

10
00:00:55.835 --> 00:00:59.101
Hair. Say it with me. Hair!

11
00:01:02.600 --> 00:01:06.617
Strong. Say it with me. Strong!

12
00:01:10.155 --> 00:01:13.971
Healthy. Say it with me. Healthy!

13
00:01:17.418 --> 00:01:20.902
Body. Say it with me. Body!

14
00:01:24.409 --> 00:01:27.859
Care. Say it with me. Care!

15
00:01:31.425 --> 00:01:41.293
Grammar time! I have / I use. Listen. I have two eyes. I use my hands to write.

16
00:01:41.343 --> 00:01:47.837
Your turn. Say it with me. I have two eyes. I use my hands to write.

17
00:01:52.813 --> 00:02:01.846
I use my hands and feet every day. My eyes and ears help me see and hear. Exercise keeps my body strong and healthy.

18
00:02:01.896 --> 00:02:03.485
I like this story!

19
00:02:04.459 --> 00:02:09.724
Look! What's the word?

20
00:02:09.774 --> 00:02:10.924
Foot!

21
00:02:11.740 --> 00:02:17.051
Look! What's the word?

22
00:02:17.101 --> 00:02:18.251
Strong!

23
00:02:19.128 --> 00:02:27.705
Think and answer. What do you do to keep your body healthy?

24
00:02:27.755 --> 00:02:28.961
Great answer!

25
00:02:30.006 --> 00:02:34.478
Great work today! See you next time. Goodbye!

26
00:02:34.528 --> 00:02:36.066
Goodbye, everyone!

